  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What is the availability target for billing-api?\n[2025-11-04] standup/boreal/2025-11-04: No deploys to the billing API from 2025-11-24 to 2025-12-02 because of the peak season. [2025-09-09] standup/boreal/2025-09-09: Changes to the billing API need a rollback plan attached to the pull request. [2025-09-08] standup/boreal/2025-09-08-2: New dependency for billing-api: feature-flags. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. Boreal noticed that the notifier's request volume halved after the client rollout and pinged the owners.",
